(5493254, 792072, 88613, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! Unfortunately the jpg compression really distracts from the image. I noticed the file is only 42kb and I think if you had saved it closer to the 150kb that is allowed it would have done much better. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Very nice shot! Unfortunately the jpg compression really distracts from the image. I noticed the file is only 42kb and I think if you had saved it closer to the 150kb that is allowed it would have done much better. Keep up the good work!', '2009-05-20 01:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
