(5493266, 792239, 88613, '<td valign="top">Great capture and a very pretty girl! I think the lighting is a little harsh though. Moving the flash 45 degrees to the left or right and/or adding a modifer, umbrella, etc. would have helped soften the light and give a more natural shadow pattern. Nice capture though. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Great capture and a very pretty girl! I think the lighting is a little harsh though. Moving the flash 45 degrees to the left or right and/or adding a modifer, umbrella, etc. would have helped soften the light and give a more natural shadow pattern. Nice capture though. Keep up the good work!', '2009-05-20 01:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
