(5493398, 791529, 44825, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot but I am struggling to see how it fits the challenge - sorry</td>', 'I really like this shot but I am struggling to see how it fits the challenge - sorry', '2009-05-20 03:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493420, 792338, 96534, '<td valign="top">This works for me, the colours and light are great. Although I''m not entirely sure what she''s doing with her hands, they seem almost as though they come from another person. But at the same time they create a power in the image, so I can''t help swinging on whether I like them or not! Does she play the cello by any chance? She has the perfect positioning for both hands, nice short nails and I think I can see cello callouses, lol. Great image, it kept me here for ages! 8.</td>', 'This works for me, the colours and light are great. Although I''m not entirely sure what she''s doing with her hands, they seem almost as though they come from another person. But at the same time they create a power in the image, so I can''t help swinging on whether I like them or not! Does she play the cello by any chance? She has the perfect positioning for both hands, nice short nails and I think I can see cello callouses, lol. Great image, it kept me here for ages! 8.', '2009-05-20 03:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493421, 792339, 102534, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is fantastic. the colour, lights, framing .. a worthy 10</td>', 'Wow, this is fantastic. the colour, lights, framing .. a worthy 10', '2009-05-20 03:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493423, 792266, 96534, '<td valign="top">I love your lighting on the girl, and she''s very glamorous, but I find that shelf in the background really distracting and cold, it doesn''t seem to add to the image in any way. Gorgeous work on the girl though.</td>', 'I love your lighting on the girl, and she''s very glamorous, but I find that shelf in the background really distracting and cold, it doesn''t seem to add to the image in any way. Gorgeous work on the girl though.', '2009-05-20 03:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
