(5493428, 792136, 96534, '<td valign="top">I really love this image but I''m not seeing glamour - its more grunge than anything. Hope you didn''t accidentally enter it in the wrong challenge.....</td>', 'I really love this image but I''m not seeing glamour - its more grunge than anything. Hope you didn''t accidentally enter it in the wrong challenge.....', '2009-05-20 03:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493435, 790838, 96534, '<td valign="top">Wow, its dorothy!!! Great 50s style shot, it works really well - the only thing I wish is that she''d taken out the nose ring.....kind of incongruous for this style of image.</td>', 'Wow, its dorothy!!! Great 50s style shot, it works really well - the only thing I wish is that she''d taken out the nose ring.....kind of incongruous for this style of image.', '2009-05-20 03:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493437, 792107, 96534, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a Liza minnelli shot - beautiful lighting and those eyelashes really work</td>', 'This reminds me of a Liza minnelli shot - beautiful lighting and those eyelashes really work', '2009-05-20 03:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493440, 792337, 96534, '<td valign="top">Wow, this has huge impact. An unusual model with a very 1920''s feel to her, plus very painterly PP, suits her colouring and the pose. Well done, hope you do well!</td>', 'Wow, this has huge impact. An unusual model with a very 1920''s feel to her, plus very painterly PP, suits her colouring and the pose. Well done, hope you do well!', '2009-05-20 03:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493444, 792276, 102534, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and lighting</td>', 'Lovely shot and lighting', '2009-05-20 03:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493445, 792343, 96534, '<td valign="top">I''m SO glad to see someone dared to bring in a child for the glamour challenge, after all the debate about what glamour is. This is a great shot, of course little girls can be glamorous, and her predicament with the lipstick is wonderful. Well done!</td>', 'I''m SO glad to see someone dared to bring in a child for the glamour challenge, after all the debate about what glamour is. This is a great shot, of course little girls can be glamorous, and her predicament with the lipstick is wonderful. Well done!', '2009-05-20 03:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493448, 791867, 96534, '<td valign="top">Priceless expression.... what did you do wrong, click the shutter too loudly? lol. I love this shot!</td>', 'Priceless expression.... what did you do wrong, click the shutter too loudly? lol. I love this shot!', '2009-05-20 03:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493498, 790838, 60173, '<td valign="top">Truly captivating. I admire your self control on the eyes. You could have so easily gone with the all too common ultra saturation, but you left it subtle as with the rest of your image.</td>', 'Truly captivating. I admire your self control on the eyes. You could have so easily gone with the all too common ultra saturation, but you left it subtle as with the rest of your image.', '2009-05-20 04:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493501, 792337, 60173, '<td valign="top">Great icy blues with just the right amount of shimmer and softness.</td>', 'Great icy blues with just the right amount of shimmer and softness.', '2009-05-20 04:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493577, 792107, 33736, '<td valign="top">This has such a ''Greta Garbo'' look - it''s absolutely beautiful! 9</td>', 'This has such a ''Greta Garbo'' look - it''s absolutely beautiful! 9', '2009-05-20 05:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493578, 791909, 33736, '<td valign="top">More subjective than anything, but it simply doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'More subjective than anything, but it simply doesn''t appeal to me.', '2009-05-20 05:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493579, 791218, 33736, '<td valign="top">The Bubbles (bluish outline and whitish reflective spots) are especially distracting around her nose and mouth area. It''s a nice concept, but it isn''t working for me.</td>', 'The Bubbles (bluish outline and whitish reflective spots) are especially distracting around her nose and mouth area. It''s a nice concept, but it isn''t working for me.', '2009-05-20 05:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493581, 791360, 33736, '<td valign="top">The shadow (and white spot) in her arm pit plus the shadow in her cleavage are a bit distracting.  The eyes and the streak in her hair are terrific.</td>', 'The shadow (and white spot) in her arm pit plus the shadow in her cleavage are a bit distracting.  The eyes and the streak in her hair are terrific.', '2009-05-20 05:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493582, 792110, 33736, '<td valign="top">The background elements (pole, shadow above her head, etc) are distracting.</td>', 'The background elements (pole, shadow above her head, etc) are distracting.', '2009-05-20 06:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493584, 792065, 33736, '<td valign="top">Including her legs and hand in such a fragmented way weakened what I think is a fabulous portrait.  I would maybe have cropped 1/2 way up into her right breast.</td>', 'Including her legs and hand in such a fragmented way weakened what I think is a fabulous portrait.  I would maybe have cropped 1/2 way up into her right breast.', '2009-05-20 06:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
