(5493624, 790895, 42781, '<td valign="top">With solid post-processing, this can be a really beautiful image.<br/>Nice composition, colors and lights - just the details are bit imperfect.<br/> <br/>One of the best within competition.</td>', 'With solid post-processing, this can be a really beautiful image.Nice composition, colors and lights - just the details are bit imperfect. One of the best within competition.', '2009-05-20 06:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
