(5493834, 791218, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun shot with the bubbles.  Some may find them distracting, but overall I like it.  The one floating in front of her left eye gives her eye an odd color.  Her right eye seems to have had some selective sharpening applied and may be a tad oversharpened.  Just my opinion...  Good luck.</td>', 'Fun shot with the bubbles.  Some may find them distracting, but overall I like it.  The one floating in front of her left eye gives her eye an odd color.  Her right eye seems to have had some selective sharpening applied and may be a tad oversharpened.  Just my opinion...  Good luck.', '2009-05-20 09:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
