(5493846, 792216, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "ok".  Seems a bit cheesy with the stiff, doll-like pose IMO.  Some fill light would have helped a bit I think.  Right now the best lighting is on the upper left of her shirt and upper chest area.  Just some observations.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s "ok".  Seems a bit cheesy with the stiff, doll-like pose IMO.  Some fill light would have helped a bit I think.  Right now the best lighting is on the upper left of her shirt and upper chest area.  Just some observations.  Good luck.', '2009-05-20 10:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
