(5494144, 792276, 105783, '<td valign="top">This picture is beautiful, the necklace as well as the look in this models'' magnificent eyes just tells the entire history of the necklace around her neck.</td>', 'This picture is beautiful, the necklace as well as the look in this models'' magnificent eyes just tells the entire history of the necklace around her neck.', '2009-05-20 13:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494147, 792026, 105783, '<td valign="top">This picture is a tad grainy or shmeared with color, cute idea but could have been a bit clearer</td>', 'This picture is a tad grainy or shmeared with color, cute idea but could have been a bit clearer', '2009-05-20 13:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494154, 792261, 105783, '<td valign="top">This picture is really pretty except for the left edge of the diamond ring being a tad blurry</td>', 'This picture is really pretty except for the left edge of the diamond ring being a tad blurry', '2009-05-20 13:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494158, 792266, 30049, '<td valign="top">Stunning model, and a wonderful photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Stunning model, and a wonderful photo.  Well done!', '2009-05-20 13:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494161, 792196, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Not sure where to categorize this.  Doesn''t speak "glamour" to me personally.  From a technical standpoint the image is well composed and the lighting is somewhat harsh.   Try and diffuse the light a little if you can (bounce, or use mesh/light cloth, etc...).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Not sure where to categorize this.  Doesn''t speak "glamour" to me personally.  From a technical standpoint the image is well composed and the lighting is somewhat harsh.   Try and diffuse the light a little if you can (bounce, or use mesh/light cloth, etc...).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-05-20 13:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494163, 792349, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s some hair. :-)  The bg is very busy, too busy IMO.  Feels like something in the processing stage toned down details of her skin and hair.</td>', 'Wow!  That''s some hair. :-)  The bg is very busy, too busy IMO.  Feels like something in the processing stage toned down details of her skin and hair.', '2009-05-20 13:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494165, 792065, 30049, '<td valign="top">Is "Deep Purple" the subject matter we should be interested in here?   Your model is very attractive and doesn''t need the "sex sells" approach IMO.  You''ve done a very nice job with lighting and all technical aspects of this challenge entry.  Good luck.</td>', 'Is "Deep Purple" the subject matter we should be interested in here?   Your model is very attractive and doesn''t need the "sex sells" approach IMO.  You''ve done a very nice job with lighting and all technical aspects of this challenge entry.  Good luck.', '2009-05-20 13:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494168, 791294, 30049, '<td valign="top">An unusual pose.  Seems almost too casual, like a snapshot type image, for this challenge.</td>', 'An unusual pose.  Seems almost too casual, like a snapshot type image, for this challenge.', '2009-05-20 13:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494171, 792033, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "ok".  A bit impersonal.  No connection with the viewer and the outfit being all black, has no detail and lends no contribution to any potential story here.</td>', 'It''s "ok".  A bit impersonal.  No connection with the viewer and the outfit being all black, has no detail and lends no contribution to any potential story here.', '2009-05-20 14:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494174, 791319, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but feels disconnected.  Kind of like you''re (the viewer) just passing by some event.  White balance is a little on the warm side.</td>', 'Interesting, but feels disconnected.  Kind of like you''re (the viewer) just passing by some event.  White balance is a little on the warm side.', '2009-05-20 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494175, 792352, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m trying to see the connection here but it''s escaping me.  Some of that may be due to the item (some piece of jewelry I take it) being OOF.</td>', 'Ok, I''m trying to see the connection here but it''s escaping me.  Some of that may be due to the item (some piece of jewelry I take it) being OOF.', '2009-05-20 14:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494177, 791360, 30049, '<td valign="top">Like the model, the lighting, the focus and her intensity.  Not liking the wrinkled background.  Nice B/W conversion BTW.  Good luck.</td>', 'Like the model, the lighting, the focus and her intensity.  Not liking the wrinkled background.  Nice B/W conversion BTW.  Good luck.', '2009-05-20 14:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494179, 791529, 30049, '<td valign="top">??!  This is a great abstract photo.  The railing on the right adds a nice touch.  Not seeing anything "glamour"-ish here IMO.  Good luck.</td>', '??!  This is a great abstract photo.  The railing on the right adds a nice touch.  Not seeing anything "glamour"-ish here IMO.  Good luck.', '2009-05-20 14:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494181, 792138, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  I like the soft focus and clarity.  This is captured well photographically, but what are you trying to say?  What''s the pitch, what''s the story?  Are they friends?  Are they more than friends?  Two of them seem to be disrobed except for the towel/blanket.</td>', 'Ok.  I like the soft focus and clarity.  This is captured well photographically, but what are you trying to say?  What''s the pitch, what''s the story?  Are they friends?  Are they more than friends?  Two of them seem to be disrobed except for the towel/blanket.', '2009-05-20 14:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494182, 792278, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sigh...yep, it''s a statue.  With tinsel &amp; foil on it.</td>', 'Sigh...yep, it''s a statue.  With tinsel & foil on it.', '2009-05-20 14:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494184, 792288, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yah!  I was getting worried after the last handful of images I voted on.  This is a nice glamour type shot.  Good use of props, etc...  Only thing I''m wishing was stronger is the focus on her eyes.  Seems like the focal point missed a tad.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yah!  I was getting worried after the last handful of images I voted on.  This is a nice glamour type shot.  Good use of props, etc...  Only thing I''m wishing was stronger is the focus on her eyes.  Seems like the focal point missed a tad.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-05-20 14:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494190, 790860, 30049, '<td valign="top">The setup has potential but there''s a handful of things really holding this back IMO.  The metal pole on the left...move right if possible to eliminate it.  Her hand lost some fingers behind that pole.  Her feet...you chopped them off.  Same with the top of her head.  Need a healthy shot of contrast to bring out the color &amp; textures.  The natural light coming from the right is causing some reflections on the handrail and brick wall.  A polarizer would knock that right out for you.  Just some observations.  Good luck.</td>', 'The setup has potential but there''s a handful of things really holding this back IMO.  The metal pole on the left...move right if possible to eliminate it.  Her hand lost some fingers behind that pole.  Her feet...you chopped them off.  Same with the top of her head.  Need a healthy shot of contrast to bring out the color & textures.  The natural light coming from the right is causing some reflections on the handrail and brick wall.  A polarizer would knock that right out for you.  Just some observations.  Good luck.', '2009-05-20 14:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494192, 790993, 30049, '<td valign="top">???!  "Glamour"?  How?</td>', '???!  "Glamour"?  How?', '2009-05-20 14:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494194, 792037, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun.  Kinda snapshottish, but still a happy photo.  I like the B/W conversion.  Seems a tad oversharpened.</td>', 'This is fun.  Kinda snapshottish, but still a happy photo.  I like the B/W conversion.  Seems a tad oversharpened.', '2009-05-20 14:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494203, 791626, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is more like yoga or sexually provocative?  I do know that it seems to be more about the human form than the individual.  Maybe I''m missing something...is this pose supposed to be glamourous?</td>', 'Not sure if this is more like yoga or sexually provocative?  I do know that it seems to be more about the human form than the individual.  Maybe I''m missing something...is this pose supposed to be glamourous?', '2009-05-20 14:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494209, 791978, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yes, a very pretty smile.  The starburst pattern in the background is interesting.  I can''t help but wonder how this would have done more dressed up (using this bg) instead of jeans and a wooden chair, using slacks or tights and a chrome chair.  Just thinking out loud.   Anyway, good luck.</td>', 'Yes, a very pretty smile.  The starburst pattern in the background is interesting.  I can''t help but wonder how this would have done more dressed up (using this bg) instead of jeans and a wooden chair, using slacks or tights and a chrome chair.  Just thinking out loud.   Anyway, good luck.', '2009-05-20 14:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494220, 791581, 30049, '<td valign="top">With the way she appears to be plastic and the clothing more emphasized (sharp), it seems strange.  Her face and hair are so soft and smoothed out (lost detail) that she seems OOF in comparison to the clothing and water.</td>', 'With the way she appears to be plastic and the clothing more emphasized (sharp), it seems strange.  Her face and hair are so soft and smoothed out (lost detail) that she seems OOF in comparison to the clothing and water.', '2009-05-20 14:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494221, 790895, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  Subtle (low key makeup) yet effective.</td>', 'This is nice.  Subtle (low key makeup) yet effective.', '2009-05-20 14:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494230, 791870, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s ok.  When you lose eye contact then it becomes less personal.  I find myself roaming around this image looking for a place to settle.  The upper part of this is well focused (hairline, scarf, eyebrows) but fades away at the bottom.  Without having her eyes as a focal point the mouth becomes more important, and that''s falling outside the focal plane.  Did you consider a severe crop removing the top third or so?  I scrolled down to see what it felt like without the upper left creamy washout...kind of liked it.  Anyway, I''m just thinking out loud.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s ok.  When you lose eye contact then it becomes less personal.  I find myself roaming around this image looking for a place to settle.  The upper part of this is well focused (hairline, scarf, eyebrows) but fades away at the bottom.  Without having her eyes as a focal point the mouth becomes more important, and that''s falling outside the focal plane.  Did you consider a severe crop removing the top third or so?  I scrolled down to see what it felt like without the upper left creamy washout...kind of liked it.  Anyway, I''m just thinking out loud.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-05-20 14:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494233, 792118, 30049, '<td valign="top">A unique photo.  Not getting the glamour connection, especially considering that the face has melted into the water (which feels a bit bizarre).  Could be slightly underexposed also.</td>', 'A unique photo.  Not getting the glamour connection, especially considering that the face has melted into the water (which feels a bit bizarre).  Could be slightly underexposed also.', '2009-05-20 14:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494236, 792072, 30049, '<td valign="top">Did you know this photo is only 42kb?  You have 200 for advanced editing.  If this wasn''t all pixelated it could stand a chance of doing well.  Looks like a nice photo, just can''t really see it.  :-/</td>', 'Did you know this photo is only 42kb?  You have 200 for advanced editing.  If this wasn''t all pixelated it could stand a chance of doing well.  Looks like a nice photo, just can''t really see it.  :-/', '2009-05-20 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494241, 791844, 327, '<td valign="top">I wanted to score this higher because your color is so appealing and I think this shot fits the challenge.<br/>However.. awkward pose/crop and the focus and light on her face is a little bit soft.</td>', 'I wanted to score this higher because your color is so appealing and I think this shot fits the challenge.However.. awkward pose/crop and the focus and light on her face is a little bit soft.', '2009-05-20 14:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494243, 792193, 30049, '<td valign="top">I lke most of this.  The outfit is nice (except that she appears to have a bandaged finger).  The lighting is certainly dramatic and has potential.  Some backlighting on her face is needed IMO (reflector to bounce back would be ideal).  Would like to also see more of her face, rather than the extreme turned away angle.  And WHAT is that black rectangle in front of her?</td>', 'I lke most of this.  The outfit is nice (except that she appears to have a bandaged finger).  The lighting is certainly dramatic and has potential.  Some backlighting on her face is needed IMO (reflector to bounce back would be ideal).  Would like to also see more of her face, rather than the extreme turned away angle.  And WHAT is that black rectangle in front of her?', '2009-05-20 14:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494245, 792349, 327, '<td valign="top">Lipstick rocks this shot along with the hair! Very cute. Focus on her fack is a bit soft, still I like this one.</td>', 'Lipstick rocks this shot along with the hair! Very cute. Focus on her fack is a bit soft, still I like this one.', '2009-05-20 14:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494246, 792276, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is nice overall, however it feels like the necklace is stealing the show.  It''s the most prominent part of the image and has the prime focal point.  Beautiful model.  Don''t make her secondary.</td>', 'This is nice overall, however it feels like the necklace is stealing the show.  It''s the most prominent part of the image and has the prime focal point.  Beautiful model.  Don''t make her secondary.', '2009-05-20 14:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494251, 792337, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very classical feel to this.  Nice job in post.  Sexy enough but not over the top.  Maybe a bit too dark around her eye (looks bruised almost).  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very classical feel to this.  Nice job in post.  Sexy enough but not over the top.  Maybe a bit too dark around her eye (looks bruised almost).  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck.', '2009-05-20 14:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494253, 792149, 327, '<td valign="top">She is screaming GLAMOUR!!! Beautiful girl, <b>great light </b>on her face. You nailed this shot. Congrats.</td>', 'She is screaming GLAMOUR!!! Beautiful girl, great light on her face. You nailed this shot. Congrats.', '2009-05-20 14:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494255, 791219, 30049, '<td valign="top">Too much emphasis and lighting on her hands and the radio.  Those need to be de-emphasized and more put on her lovely face.  The hat/feather combo was a good choice, just need to see more of it.</td>', 'Too much emphasis and lighting on her hands and the radio.  Those need to be de-emphasized and more put on her lovely face.  The hat/feather combo was a good choice, just need to see more of it.', '2009-05-20 14:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494256, 792352, 327, '<td valign="top">Sorry I''ve looked and looked but can''t tell what this is? A pearl on what? Sorry.</td>', 'Sorry I''ve looked and looked but can''t tell what this is? A pearl on what? Sorry.', '2009-05-20 14:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494257, 792074, 327, '<td valign="top">Whoops. Looks like the camera moved a bit.</td>', 'Whoops. Looks like the camera moved a bit.', '2009-05-20 14:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494258, 791867, 30049, '<td valign="top">What, was the shutter too loud?  :-)</td>', 'What, was the shutter too loud?  :-)', '2009-05-20 14:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494260, 792136, 100335, '<td valign="top">ok i love this shot. Its very touching and sad. But i''m worried about its relevance... Nothing here suggests glamour to me. Theres also a strange Haze that i just noticed on top of the boys head not quite sure what it is?<br/> <br/>Overall this is just a brilliant capture.</td>', 'ok i love this shot. Its very touching and sad. But i''m worried about its relevance... Nothing here suggests glamour to me. Theres also a strange Haze that i just noticed on top of the boys head not quite sure what it is? Overall this is just a brilliant capture.', '2009-05-20 14:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494264, 790858, 30049, '<td valign="top">Karen seems like an eager model.  Why not get her in a more comfortable pose and a more photogenic environment?   Even a slightly different POV here would work if you had nowhere else to go.  A move to the left might have gotten rid of the piece of building peeking into the upper left.  The partial tree needs to go as well.  Just some observations.  Good luck.</td>', 'Karen seems like an eager model.  Why not get her in a more comfortable pose and a more photogenic environment?   Even a slightly different POV here would work if you had nowhere else to go.  A move to the left might have gotten rid of the piece of building peeking into the upper left.  The partial tree needs to go as well.  Just some observations.  Good luck.', '2009-05-20 14:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494267, 791999, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative idea and love the red lips, lighting, pose and her makeup. You met the challenge 100% just don''t like the tight crop.</td>', 'Creative idea and love the red lips, lighting, pose and her makeup. You met the challenge 100% just don''t like the tight crop.', '2009-05-20 14:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494268, 791728, 30049, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl.  With a little better focus on the eyes and a larger image overall (you used 444 pixels when you had 720 available), you may have been onto something here.</td>', 'Pretty girl.  With a little better focus on the eyes and a larger image overall (you used 444 pixels when you had 720 available), you may have been onto something here.', '2009-05-20 14:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494269, 790838, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like how you left just a hint of color in this and kept her green eyes available.  Chickened out on a title, eh?  :-)</td>', 'I like how you left just a hint of color in this and kept her green eyes available.  Chickened out on a title, eh?  :-)', '2009-05-20 15:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494270, 792012, 327, '<td valign="top">Pam Anderson look-a-like only this girl is much prettier. Your light, skin tone, and pose is very professional. Wonderful work.</td>', 'Pam Anderson look-a-like only this girl is much prettier. Your light, skin tone, and pose is very professional. Wonderful work.', '2009-05-20 15:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494271, 791719, 327, '<td valign="top">The eyes have it!!! Nicely done.</td>', 'The eyes have it!!! Nicely done.', '2009-05-20 15:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494316, 790838, 52130, '<td valign="top">she looks like a doll! i don''t think this is very glamour, but I love the shot</td>', 'she looks like a doll! i don''t think this is very glamour, but I love the shot', '2009-05-20 15:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494334, 792192, 92577, '<td valign="top">elegant</td>', 'elegant', '2009-05-20 16:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
