(5494380, 792064, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  I can see where maybe this might work in the right setting.  Kind of feels out of place in the overgrown grass, but I''m sure others will see different.  As for the technicals it seems that you have a smidge of lens flare going on that''s making the heel and mid-section of the shoe flatten out and need some contrast.  Tricky one to comment on.  Sorry, and good luck.</td>', 'Ok.  I can see where maybe this might work in the right setting.  Kind of feels out of place in the overgrown grass, but I''m sure others will see different.  As for the technicals it seems that you have a smidge of lens flare going on that''s making the heel and mid-section of the shoe flatten out and need some contrast.  Tricky one to comment on.  Sorry, and good luck.', '2009-05-20 16:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494384, 792346, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  "Glamour"???  It''s an ok shot as far as being of interest to view.  I can''t get away from the blue space in the background...it keeps pulling me over there.  Appears to be oversharpened overall.  Another one that''s hard to give feedback on.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  "Glamour"???  It''s an ok shot as far as being of interest to view.  I can''t get away from the blue space in the background...it keeps pulling me over there.  Appears to be oversharpened overall.  Another one that''s hard to give feedback on.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-05-20 16:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5494386, 792078, 30049, '<td valign="top">Kind of goofing around like the guy in the picture by entering this?  First thing to jump out is the strange red tones, then the blur.  Not seeing how this works for the challenge, but hey, each their own I guess.  Good luck.</td>', 'Kind of goofing around like the guy in the picture by entering this?  First thing to jump out is the strange red tones, then the blur.  Not seeing how this works for the challenge, but hey, each their own I guess.  Good luck.', '2009-05-20 16:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
