(5495820, 791844, 100773, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have used bluish colors her. The water (at least I think it is), her clothing and her make up, and that alone qualifies for a glamourous picture. However, it could''ve been interesting to try a brown color theme instead, since that would''ve matched her eyes and hair. Or the complete oposite to create a smoother contrast, but that''s just personal ideas =) Well done, and a good photo!</td>', 'I like the way you have used bluish colors her. The water (at least I think it is), her clothing and her make up, and that alone qualifies for a glamourous picture. However, it could''ve been interesting to try a brown color theme instead, since that would''ve matched her eyes and hair. Or the complete oposite to create a smoother contrast, but that''s just personal ideas =) Well done, and a good photo!', '2009-05-21 19:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5495829, 791219, 100773, '<td valign="top">Photos like this makes me question whether I know what glamour is or not. Personally I don''t see the glamour here. If you had have eye contact and editet it in "retro" black and white so it would look Marilyn Monroeish , then it would fit my idea of glamour alot better. But aside from that, it''s a perfect picture! Maybe the hand in front could''ve been more in focus, but that''s nitpicking. So I''ll give you a 6, also reasoned that I thought my entry was a bit glamourous, but DPC thought otherwise. Point is, good photo =)</td>', 'Photos like this makes me question whether I know what glamour is or not. Personally I don''t see the glamour here. If you had have eye contact and editet it in "retro" black and white so it would look Marilyn Monroeish , then it would fit my idea of glamour alot better. But aside from that, it''s a perfect picture! Maybe the hand in front could''ve been more in focus, but that''s nitpicking. So I''ll give you a 6, also reasoned that I thought my entry was a bit glamourous, but DPC thought otherwise. Point is, good photo =)', '2009-05-21 20:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5495833, 792278, 100773, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked this to be a photo of a woman. The same shiny stuff, but on a woman. So I don''t see much of glamour in this. Sorry. But, a creative idea nevertheless.</td>', 'I would''ve liked this to be a photo of a woman. The same shiny stuff, but on a woman. So I don''t see much of glamour in this. Sorry. But, a creative idea nevertheless.', '2009-05-21 20:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
