(5497422, 790858, 96572, '<td valign="top">Next time watch that you don''t cut off the leg, also try shooting from a lower angle (crouch down a bit)</td>', 'Next time watch that you don''t cut off the leg, also try shooting from a lower angle (crouch down a bit)', '2009-05-23 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497426, 791745, 96572, '<td valign="top">Next time try to have the model look up or to the side, this more of a candid  picture.</td>', 'Next time try to have the model look up or to the side, this more of a candid  picture.', '2009-05-23 14:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497428, 792349, 96572, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit noisy on my monitor - higher ISO? look @ that hair!</td>', 'Looks a bit noisy on my monitor - higher ISO? look @ that hair!', '2009-05-23 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497430, 792026, 96572, '<td valign="top">Good idea, looks a bit noisy on monitor and the light is a bit too yellowish for my liking.</td>', 'Good idea, looks a bit noisy on monitor and the light is a bit too yellowish for my liking.', '2009-05-23 14:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497435, 791728, 96572, '<td valign="top">hey great summery picture, what''s up with the size?</td>', 'hey great summery picture, what''s up with the size?', '2009-05-23 14:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497444, 791978, 96572, '<td valign="top">Interesting background.</td>', 'Interesting background.', '2009-05-23 14:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497452, 792367, 96572, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture! I love the DOF, great light, great expression from the model.  Simple and yet peaceful, perfect 10 for me.  One of my favorites and I hope to see it at minimum in top 10 and ideally be a ribbon winner!<br/> <br/>Amazing! Amazing! Did I say amazing? A M A Z I N G !</td>', 'Amazing picture! I love the DOF, great light, great expression from the model.  Simple and yet peaceful, perfect 10 for me.  One of my favorites and I hope to see it at minimum in top 10 and ideally be a ribbon winner! Amazing! Amazing! Did I say amazing? A M A Z I N G !', '2009-05-23 14:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497453, 792338, 96572, '<td valign="top">Great make up, great pose, excellent picture</td>', 'Great make up, great pose, excellent picture', '2009-05-23 14:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497456, 792339, 96572, '<td valign="top">Good job! Love the light in the background!</td>', 'Good job! Love the light in the background!', '2009-05-23 14:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497457, 792276, 96572, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great picture!</td>', 'Wow! Great picture!', '2009-05-23 14:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497458, 792337, 96572, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but this model reminds me of Lady Gaga (the singer).  Good picture.</td>', 'I don''t know why but this model reminds me of Lady Gaga (the singer).  Good picture.', '2009-05-23 14:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497460, 792261, 96572, '<td valign="top">Simple, glamorous ... only thing I would pick on is the DOF, wonder if the picture would pop out that much more if the rose was in focus.  Creative idea!</td>', 'Simple, glamorous ... only thing I would pick on is the DOF, wonder if the picture would pop out that much more if the rose was in focus.  Creative idea!', '2009-05-23 14:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497461, 792279, 96572, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a capture, crisp! Wow!</td>', 'Wow! What a capture, crisp! Wow!', '2009-05-23 14:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497462, 792343, 96572, '<td valign="top">Great expression by the girl! Made me laugh! Creative!</td>', 'Great expression by the girl! Made me laugh! Creative!', '2009-05-23 14:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497463, 790838, 96572, '<td valign="top">ooooo ... beautiful eyes</td>', 'ooooo ... beautiful eyes', '2009-05-23 14:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497464, 791282, 96572, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, what''s up with the size?</td>', 'Nice pic, what''s up with the size?', '2009-05-23 14:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497465, 791999, 96572, '<td valign="top">Great idea, the crop is just a little tight for my liking but nice and sharp, and love how the red pops!</td>', 'Great idea, the crop is just a little tight for my liking but nice and sharp, and love how the red pops!', '2009-05-23 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497495, 792339, 19311, '<td valign="top">The only image in the group that wow''d me.  Excellent job. Love the backlighting. To nit pick, the shadow coming across her nose bothers me and I assume you could edit that with your skill, must be the hair light above?  All the crazy stray hairs, but I understand how annoying and difficult those are to be free of.  Lastly, just the randomness of the umbrella, where is it coming from, how is it being held, etc...  Would like to have seen the models hands engaged with it.  Hope to be next to you at the top :) 9</td>', 'The only image in the group that wow''d me.  Excellent job. Love the backlighting. To nit pick, the shadow coming across her nose bothers me and I assume you could edit that with your skill, must be the hair light above?  All the crazy stray hairs, but I understand how annoying and difficult those are to be free of.  Lastly, just the randomness of the umbrella, where is it coming from, how is it being held, etc...  Would like to have seen the models hands engaged with it.  Hope to be next to you at the top :) 9', '2009-05-23 15:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497509, 792276, 19311, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, the editing a,little over the top with the blur but not bad.  The hair, great. My biggest concern here is the angle of the shoulders.  The movement in the body is very lifeless.  By turning her a little more sideways or dipping the left shoulder down.  Then concentrating on expressin too, it would really have made everything pop.  You might even see less of the necklace but the overall impact would make it seem even nicer.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, the editing a,little over the top with the blur but not bad.  The hair, great. My biggest concern here is the angle of the shoulders.  The movement in the body is very lifeless.  By turning her a little more sideways or dipping the left shoulder down.  Then concentrating on expressin too, it would really have made everything pop.  You might even see less of the necklace but the overall impact would make it seem even nicer.', '2009-05-23 15:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497663, 792074, 78371, '<td valign="top">The doll is pretty, in order to show that more, the photograph should be in focus.</td>', 'The doll is pretty, in order to show that more, the photograph should be in focus.', '2009-05-23 19:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497668, 792164, 78371, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh and I think that the model is more emo than glamorous.  I do like the the tonal quality of the pic though.</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh and I think that the model is more emo than glamorous.  I do like the the tonal quality of the pic though.', '2009-05-23 19:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497670, 792306, 78371, '<td valign="top">This photo fits the challenge perfectly. 10</td>', 'This photo fits the challenge perfectly. 10', '2009-05-23 19:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497671, 791294, 78371, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot because of the implied sexiness without really showing anything. Also, I love the composition and the out of focus shine of her high heels. 9</td>', 'I really like this shot because of the implied sexiness without really showing anything. Also, I love the composition and the out of focus shine of her high heels. 9', '2009-05-23 19:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497672, 792192, 78371, '<td valign="top">That is a hat fit for the queen of england. :)  The softness and the placement of the hat over her one eye really works in the photo.</td>', 'That is a hat fit for the queen of england. :)  The softness and the placement of the hat over her one eye really works in the photo.', '2009-05-23 19:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497673, 792338, 78371, '<td valign="top">The placement of the hands really make the composition. Also, the eyeshadow and lip colors are really, for lack of a better word, glamorous.  IMHO the eyebrow make-up is a bit too harsh making her look just a tad upset or angry but not enough for me to decrease the score.  9</td>', 'The placement of the hands really make the composition. Also, the eyeshadow and lip colors are really, for lack of a better word, glamorous.  IMHO the eyebrow make-up is a bit too harsh making her look just a tad upset or angry but not enough for me to decrease the score.  9', '2009-05-23 19:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497675, 792107, 78371, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, I like the throwback to the old time Hollywood. 8</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, I like the throwback to the old time Hollywood. 8', '2009-05-23 19:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497676, 792349, 78371, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  I love how the hair just seems to "fit" with the pattern in the background.  I also like the little red pop of the lips.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  I love how the hair just seems to "fit" with the pattern in the background.  I also like the little red pop of the lips.', '2009-05-23 19:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5497720, 792346, 70036, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Whites are blown out and contrast seems harsh.</td>', 'Good idea.  Whites are blown out and contrast seems harsh.', '2009-05-23 21:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
