(5497833, 792276, 100687, '<td valign="top">the lighting is great. You did a good job keeping the reflection just right on the jewelry!</td>', 'the lighting is great. You did a good job keeping the reflection just right on the jewelry!', '2009-05-23 23:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
