(5500427, 792026, 96751, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t say Glamour to me.</td>', 'Doesn''t say Glamour to me.', '2009-05-26 13:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500430, 792359, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bride.  Interesting ghosting on her dress, but I think the lighting is too harsh and loses some detail.</td>', 'Beautiful bride.  Interesting ghosting on her dress, but I think the lighting is too harsh and loses some detail.', '2009-05-26 13:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500437, 792346, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the color treatment on this.  Very eyecatching and sharp.  The white skin tone is a bit odd though.</td>', 'Love the color treatment on this.  Very eyecatching and sharp.  The white skin tone is a bit odd though.', '2009-05-26 13:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500441, 792349, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot!  Can''t decide if the flock wallpaper is distracting or enhancing her crazy hair.  Love that her top echoes the colors of the background.  Side lighting is interesting, if perhaps a tiny bit harsh.  Excellent styling.</td>', 'What a fun shot!  Can''t decide if the flock wallpaper is distracting or enhancing her crazy hair.  Love that her top echoes the colors of the background.  Side lighting is interesting, if perhaps a tiny bit harsh.  Excellent styling.', '2009-05-26 13:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500444, 792131, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the abstract.  DNMC though...</td>', 'Love the abstract.  DNMC though...', '2009-05-26 13:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500447, 791382, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression, but not "glamour" to me.</td>', 'Wonderful expression, but not "glamour" to me.', '2009-05-26 13:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500448, 791719, 96751, '<td valign="top">My, what beautiful eyes you have.  Great colors, although it needs an extra something to be "glamour".</td>', 'My, what beautiful eyes you have.  Great colors, although it needs an extra something to be "glamour".', '2009-05-26 13:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500449, 792104, 96751, '<td valign="top">A classic example of Glamour - Vegas style...</td>', 'A classic example of Glamour - Vegas style...', '2009-05-26 13:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500452, 792239, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice, narrow band of tones.  Great make-up.  I find the choice of jewelry distracting, though, and far less glamorous than she is.  Pearls or some sparkly chain or even an Hermes-style scarf would have been a better choice.</td>', 'Nice, narrow band of tones.  Great make-up.  I find the choice of jewelry distracting, though, and far less glamorous than she is.  Pearls or some sparkly chain or even an Hermes-style scarf would have been a better choice.', '2009-05-26 13:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500457, 792325, 96751, '<td valign="top">If only the lighting had been more on her face, and not just the tiny line at the back of her shoulder...</td>', 'If only the lighting had been more on her face, and not just the tiny line at the back of her shoulder...', '2009-05-26 13:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500459, 791922, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fun, counter-interpretation of the challenge.  Love the shot and the perspective.  Would have preferred her turned around so that the sun was on her face.</td>', 'Fun, counter-interpretation of the challenge.  Love the shot and the perspective.  Would have preferred her turned around so that the sun was on her face.', '2009-05-26 13:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500461, 791867, 96751, '<td valign="top">A flock of seagulls...??<br/> <br/>Clearly a wedding reception.  Fun shot.  She does NOT look pleased.</td>', 'A flock of seagulls...?? Clearly a wedding reception.  Fun shot.  She does NOT look pleased.', '2009-05-26 13:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500463, 790993, 96751, '<td valign="top">A stunning shot that DNMC.  Not that Glamour has to be a human, but this doesn''t say "glamour" to me, even though it is gorgeous.</td>', 'A stunning shot that DNMC.  Not that Glamour has to be a human, but this doesn''t say "glamour" to me, even though it is gorgeous.', '2009-05-26 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500468, 791360, 96751, '<td valign="top">Too simple.  A pair of long opera gloves, or even just a pearl necklace would have really made this shot work.  The crumpled background also works against the idea of glamour by being too relaxed.  Overall, the lighting is nice, but there is a blotchy unevenness on her face, especially around the eyes, which seem to sink in a bit of shadow.</td>', 'Too simple.  A pair of long opera gloves, or even just a pearl necklace would have really made this shot work.  The crumpled background also works against the idea of glamour by being too relaxed.  Overall, the lighting is nice, but there is a blotchy unevenness on her face, especially around the eyes, which seem to sink in a bit of shadow.', '2009-05-26 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500475, 791218, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fun shot.  I think the lighting could be a bit more specific to either the model or the bubbles.  Right now, it''s not prioritizing either it''s hard to know where to look.  Great color and transparency on the bubbles, but the model is a little washed out.  On the other hand, she is sharply focused, but the bubbles are not.  Like I said, I think the lighting/focus had to be one or the other to really make this shot.</td>', 'Fun shot.  I think the lighting could be a bit more specific to either the model or the bubbles.  Right now, it''s not prioritizing either it''s hard to know where to look.  Great color and transparency on the bubbles, but the model is a little washed out.  On the other hand, she is sharply focused, but the bubbles are not.  Like I said, I think the lighting/focus had to be one or the other to really make this shot.', '2009-05-26 13:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500476, 792145, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the attitude.  This is a perfect example that Glamour doesn''t have to be blingy or scantily clad, or luxurious.  The POV, upturned chin, and glint on the glasses are terrific.  Love it.</td>', 'Love the attitude.  This is a perfect example that Glamour doesn''t have to be blingy or scantily clad, or luxurious.  The POV, upturned chin, and glint on the glasses are terrific.  Love it.', '2009-05-26 13:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500481, 792288, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great tones and lighting.  Nice dof and background bokeh.  Love the contrasting softness of her cheek and harsh line of the shawl, and that she is looking away from us.  Her expression is priceless.  The whole attitude spells glamour, that she lives in, and by, glamour.</td>', 'Very nice. Great tones and lighting.  Nice dof and background bokeh.  Love the contrasting softness of her cheek and harsh line of the shawl, and that she is looking away from us.  Her expression is priceless.  The whole attitude spells glamour, that she lives in, and by, glamour.', '2009-05-26 13:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500482, 792279, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture though I just can''t get to "glamour" with it.  The expression on the top bird is too much.</td>', 'Fantastic capture though I just can''t get to "glamour" with it.  The expression on the top bird is too much.', '2009-05-26 13:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500487, 791870, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great, fun concept, but the lighting just doesn''t work for me.  The skin tone is also oddly bluish, which isn''t complemented by the yellow/orange wrap (which is too blown out at lower left.  The reflection in the glasses is really nice and crisp, but I''m undecided about the piece of shawl reflected in the (camera) right lens.</td>', 'Great, fun concept, but the lighting just doesn''t work for me.  The skin tone is also oddly bluish, which isn''t complemented by the yellow/orange wrap (which is too blown out at lower left.  The reflection in the glasses is really nice and crisp, but I''m undecided about the piece of shawl reflected in the (camera) right lens.', '2009-05-26 13:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500493, 791294, 96751, '<td valign="top">A good effort which could have benefitted from a stylist.  I like the over-the-shoulder position, and the lighting on her profile.  But the eye is drawn instead to the long lines of her legs, which are in an unflattering position.</td>', 'A good effort which could have benefitted from a stylist.  I like the over-the-shoulder position, and the lighting on her profile.  But the eye is drawn instead to the long lines of her legs, which are in an unflattering position.', '2009-05-26 14:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500497, 792012, 96751, '<td valign="top">This looks so much like another blond model in this challenge...  This shot doesn''t work as well for me as "glamour".  Her expression is not one of glamour as much as discomfort.  I like the wind in the hair, but the rest of the shot is more "seductive" than it is "glamorous".</td>', 'This looks so much like another blond model in this challenge...  This shot doesn''t work as well for me as "glamour".  Her expression is not one of glamour as much as discomfort.  I like the wind in the hair, but the rest of the shot is more "seductive" than it is "glamorous".', '2009-05-26 14:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500499, 791529, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like your outside the box thinking on this.  Gorgeous abstract.  Love the tones, the shapes, the geometry.  Looks very Paul Klee.</td>', 'I like your outside the box thinking on this.  Gorgeous abstract.  Love the tones, the shapes, the geometry.  Looks very Paul Klee.', '2009-05-26 14:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500503, 791324, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nature''s divas...  Stunning detail.</td>', 'Nature''s divas...  Stunning detail.', '2009-05-26 14:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500506, 791993, 96751, '<td valign="top">She is definitely beautiful, and fierce.  Her wardrobe is incredible.  I like the dramatic lighting, although I think a tiny bet behind her shoulder would have added more dimension and depth.  But "glamour" is also an attitude, which she does not exhibit.  I get determination, courage, strength.  An expression with bit more langorous and self-indulgent would have been more "glamorous"</td>', 'She is definitely beautiful, and fierce.  Her wardrobe is incredible.  I like the dramatic lighting, although I think a tiny bet behind her shoulder would have added more dimension and depth.  But "glamour" is also an attitude, which she does not exhibit.  I get determination, courage, strength.  An expression with bit more langorous and self-indulgent would have been more "glamorous"', '2009-05-26 14:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500508, 792266, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful model, but she should see a doctor about that shelf coming out of her head.</td>', 'Very beautiful model, but she should see a doctor about that shelf coming out of her head.', '2009-05-26 14:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500509, 792118, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  Especially in b/w.  Abstract, puzzling, very Rorshark...  but not glamorous</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  Especially in b/w.  Abstract, puzzling, very Rorshark...  but not glamorous', '2009-05-26 14:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500511, 791999, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely model and portrait, although I think the tightness of the crop detracts from it, especially the cherries.  Also, some haloing around the stem, lips, and eyes, especially the corner of her right eye.</td>', 'Lovely model and portrait, although I think the tightness of the crop detracts from it, especially the cherries.  Also, some haloing around the stem, lips, and eyes, especially the corner of her right eye.', '2009-05-26 14:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500513, 792306, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yeah, the languid attitude in the luxury sourroundings definitely sells me glamour.  The wide angle really adds an interesting dimension.</td>', 'Yeah, the languid attitude in the luxury sourroundings definitely sells me glamour.  The wide angle really adds an interesting dimension.', '2009-05-26 14:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500515, 790838, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning eyes on this model, who is adorable.  I really like the desat on this, although there is a slight violet tint to her skin that''s odd.  Great lighting and details, strong dof.  As a portrait, everything works, except that I don''t find this glamorous :-(<br/> <br/>Maybe if she''d had a huge rock on her left hand...</td>', 'Stunning eyes on this model, who is adorable.  I really like the desat on this, although there is a slight violet tint to her skin that''s odd.  Great lighting and details, strong dof.  As a portrait, everything works, except that I don''t find this glamorous :-( Maybe if she''d had a huge rock on her left hand...', '2009-05-26 14:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500523, 792276, 96751, '<td valign="top">The only think missing for me from this shot is attitude.  A slight upward tilt of the chin to show off her neck/necklace, maybe looking up and off to the distance.</td>', 'The only think missing for me from this shot is attitude.  A slight upward tilt of the chin to show off her neck/necklace, maybe looking up and off to the distance.', '2009-05-26 14:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500526, 791626, 96751, '<td valign="top">This says so many things to me, none of them "glamour".  Gorgeous body and model, very interesting concept, spot-on execution.  But nothing in her wardrobe, make-up, accessories, body position, attitude, or even the set is "glamour".  Still, high marks for impecable photography.</td>', 'This says so many things to me, none of them "glamour".  Gorgeous body and model, very interesting concept, spot-on execution.  But nothing in her wardrobe, make-up, accessories, body position, attitude, or even the set is "glamour".  Still, high marks for impecable photography.', '2009-05-26 14:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500527, 790838, 11920, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2009-05-26 14:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500528, 792149, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.', '2009-05-26 14:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500530, 792343, 96751, '<td valign="top">My top vote for humor!  Very sweet, and really captures the attempt at glamour.  Priceless expression.</td>', 'My top vote for humor!  Very sweet, and really captures the attempt at glamour.  Priceless expression.', '2009-05-26 14:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500532, 792136, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very provocative and stirring shot, which does not belong in this challenge.</td>', 'Very provocative and stirring shot, which does not belong in this challenge.', '2009-05-26 14:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500534, 792339, 96751, '<td valign="top">I remember her!  Fabulous use of the umbrella to achieve stunning lighting.  The radial ribs really draw the eyes to the center, and the prize of her face, which is perfectly lit.  The color of her eyes might be just a tad too red, but the make-up and hair are terrific.  I''m undecided about the red flowers on her dress - they keep drawing my eye away from the main subject.  Maybe fewer of them, or slightly desaturated.</td>', 'I remember her!  Fabulous use of the umbrella to achieve stunning lighting.  The radial ribs really draw the eyes to the center, and the prize of her face, which is perfectly lit.  The color of her eyes might be just a tad too red, but the make-up and hair are terrific.  I''m undecided about the red flowers on her dress - they keep drawing my eye away from the main subject.  Maybe fewer of them, or slightly desaturated.', '2009-05-26 14:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500535, 792107, 96751, '<td valign="top">This could have been an old Hollywood headshot.  I love the mood and the lighting.</td>', 'This could have been an old Hollywood headshot.  I love the mood and the lighting.', '2009-05-26 14:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500537, 792192, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ready for the races.  Lovely shot, although the arm has much more prominence than it ought to.  Because it is so bright, it really draws from the main subject: her face and hat.</td>', 'Ready for the races.  Lovely shot, although the arm has much more prominence than it ought to.  Because it is so bright, it really draws from the main subject: her face and hat.', '2009-05-26 14:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500542, 792337, 96751, '<td valign="top">SO 1920''s.  Wonderful shot in terms of model, attitude, pose, and the silverish tone of the entire shot.  I don''t know if the wide angle helps or hurts this shot.  Great work.</td>', 'SO 1920''s.  Wonderful shot in terms of model, attitude, pose, and the silverish tone of the entire shot.  I don''t know if the wide angle helps or hurts this shot.  Great work.', '2009-05-26 14:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500680, 792074, 99708, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just my eyes, but she seems to be a tad out of focus.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just my eyes, but she seems to be a tad out of focus.', '2009-05-26 17:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500696, 792337, 33535, '<td valign="top">love the color you have created here, kinda vintage! great wide angle perspective, very sexy model and pose!</td>', 'love the color you have created here, kinda vintage! great wide angle perspective, very sexy model and pose!', '2009-05-26 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500739, 792322, 104966, '<td valign="top">nice color &amp; the texture of the shirt is nice, but some ISO loss in the hair (though the model''s hair itself looks great)</td>', 'nice color & the texture of the shirt is nice, but some ISO loss in the hair (though the model''s hair itself looks great)', '2009-05-26 18:04:05.000000', NULL, 1);
