(5500770, 792266, 104966, '<td valign="top">Very good. I can''t decide if there''s too much light on the left side or not, but the color is great, especially those eyes.  My personal fave from this competition!</td>', 'Very good. I can''t decide if there''s too much light on the left side or not, but the color is great, especially those eyes.  My personal fave from this competition!', '2009-05-26 18:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
