(5500794, 791999, 3444, '<td valign="top">I like this one but feel it would have had much more impact with just one cherry.  Eliminating the clipped one and showing a little more of the fingers would have worked better in my opinion.</td>', 'I like this one but feel it would have had much more impact with just one cherry.  Eliminating the clipped one and showing a little more of the fingers would have worked better in my opinion.', '2009-05-26 18:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500958, 791529, 43774, '<td valign="top">I hope you''re not getting voted down because this isn''t a photo of a beautiful woman. I think this is a gorgeous photo, I love the abstract quality to it, as well as the colours. 9 from me.</td>', 'I hope you''re not getting voted down because this isn''t a photo of a beautiful woman. I think this is a gorgeous photo, I love the abstract quality to it, as well as the colours. 9 from me.', '2009-05-26 22:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501015, 792131, 51747, '<td valign="top">Looks like a brown to me. No vote.</td>', 'Looks like a brown to me. No vote.', '2009-05-26 23:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5501051, 792279, 78371, '<td valign="top">This is a great moment caught in camera.  I enjoy the tension that the two bird have with each other. I am wondering are the birds in love or are they going to fight. Saying that, I feel that this image does not really go with the challenge at hand.  Now I am not saying that birds can''t imply glamour or be glamorous.  However, the subject of this image to me is the relationship which does not say "glamour"<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-27 21:58:08.</i></td>', 'This is a great moment caught in camera.  I enjoy the tension that the two bird have with each other. I am wondering are the birds in love or are they going to fight. Saying that, I feel that this image does not really go with the challenge at hand.  Now I am not saying that birds can''t imply glamour or be glamorous.  However, the subject of this image to me is the relationship which does not say "glamour"', '2009-05-26 23:38:09.000000', '2009-05-27 22:58:08.000000', 1),
(5501088, 792266, 98026, '<td valign="top">I luurrrvvvv this image. The lighting is great - and THOSE eyes WOW!!!</td>', 'I luurrrvvvv this image. The lighting is great - and THOSE eyes WOW!!!', '2009-05-27 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
