(5501147, 791922, 105783, '<td valign="top">I took the opportunity to put this picture in glamour instead of grunge for the fact of american glamour is over rated, most people hear glamour and think big hair and pancake make up but that''s not what i think i think of a true natural beauty i literally put the natural aspect of this picture in everyone''s face so that is why it is in glamour instead of grunge, i wish the comments could have reflected more about the actual picture and NOT the challenge i entered it in, at least in this case. I obviously knew what i was doing and i had faith other people could see that too. thank you for your input :)</td>', 'I took the opportunity to put this picture in glamour instead of grunge for the fact of american glamour is over rated, most people hear glamour and think big hair and pancake make up but that''s not what i think i think of a true natural beauty i literally put the natural aspect of this picture in everyone''s face so that is why it is in glamour instead of grunge, i wish the comments could have reflected more about the actual picture and NOT the challenge i entered it in, at least in this case. I obviously knew what i was doing and i had faith other people could see that too. thank you for your input :)', '2009-05-27 01:11:30.000000', NULL, 0),
