(5501850, 792266, 45524, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, when I saw this image I was blown away that it was on the front page. With how picky and anal the voters are, to put this image on the front page with the distraction in the background just boggles my mind. The model is beautiful, it has great lighting on her, but that background literally kills what could have been a really great image. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'I have to admit, when I saw this image I was blown away that it was on the front page. With how picky and anal the voters are, to put this image on the front page with the distraction in the background just boggles my mind. The model is beautiful, it has great lighting on her, but that background literally kills what could have been a really great image. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2009-05-27 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
