(5502052, 792266, 70128, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, and I admit, I didn''t think this shot would get a ribbon. Lighting, pose, and colors are very good, but I thought that shelf behind was way too distracting, and knowing DPCers, I thought many would have given this shot a low score, but then again, DPCers always prove me wrong!!! LOL I do have to congratulate you both on your ribbon and your bravery!</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, and I admit, I didn''t think this shot would get a ribbon. Lighting, pose, and colors are very good, but I thought that shelf behind was way too distracting, and knowing DPCers, I thought many would have given this shot a low score, but then again, DPCers always prove me wrong!!! LOL I do have to congratulate you both on your ribbon and your bravery!', '2009-05-27 12:13:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502055, 792322, 30982, '<td valign="top">The score on this is truly appalling.  This is a gorgeous picture showing the true beauty of a woman.  Really nicely done, Brian.  By the way, I can''t see the noise at all on the monitor I use to edit, but I can on my laptop which is a lot "brighter".</td>', 'The score on this is truly appalling.  This is a gorgeous picture showing the true beauty of a woman.  Really nicely done, Brian.  By the way, I can''t see the noise at all on the monitor I use to edit, but I can on my laptop which is a lot "brighter".', '2009-05-27 12:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502063, 792337, 33361, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite in the challenge.. of course I LOVE anything with a retro feel.. and 99.9% of your images so it was a no-brainer. : )</td>', 'This was my favorite in the challenge.. of course I LOVE anything with a retro feel.. and 99.9% of your images so it was a no-brainer. : )', '2009-05-27 12:24:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502122, 792339, 42198, '<td valign="top">Manny, when I saw this shot on the front page my heart leapt for joy. My artistic instincts told me it was you. When I clicked through to reveal this piece of heaven in it''s full glory, my soul soared to the stratosphere, my spirit cried out in ecstasy. I was drawn irresistibly in to your kaleidoscope of rainbow colour, swept along by the masterful composition and brought to tears by the power and emotion portrayed before me.<br/> <br/>Yes Manny, I wept. You lifted me from the darkest despair and ascended my spirit to a place I could only have dreamt of.<br/> <br/>Such vision, such depth, such genius. Truly you are a god amongst men.<br/></td>', 'Manny, when I saw this shot on the front page my heart leapt for joy. My artistic instincts told me it was you. When I clicked through to reveal this piece of heaven in it''s full glory, my soul soared to the stratosphere, my spirit cried out in ecstasy. I was drawn irresistibly in to your kaleidoscope of rainbow colour, swept along by the masterful composition and brought to tears by the power and emotion portrayed before me. Yes Manny, I wept. You lifted me from the darkest despair and ascended my spirit to a place I could only have dreamt of. Such vision, such depth, such genius. Truly you are a god amongst men.', '2009-05-27 12:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
