(5502400, 792276, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>beautifully done!  congrats on the ribbon!!</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!beautifully done!  congrats on the ribbon!!', '2009-05-27 15:05:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502416, 792266, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>wonderful!  And the oof shelf in the background actually helps this image quite a bit: you used the appropriate dof to blur it, which means it is not a distracting thing growing out of her head, as it is clearly in the background, but it provides a sense of depth, gives her a 3d presence in the image, which might have otherwise seemed a bit flat.   A well-deserved ribbon.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!wonderful!  And the oof shelf in the background actually helps this image quite a bit: you used the appropriate dof to blur it, which means it is not a distracting thing growing out of her head, as it is clearly in the background, but it provides a sense of depth, gives her a 3d presence in the image, which might have otherwise seemed a bit flat.   A well-deserved ribbon.', '2009-05-27 15:08:10.000000', NULL, 0),
