(5502430, 791999, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Timosaby:</b></div><hr/><i> I was almost sure this was top 10, great job though i like this photo a lot more than some of the ones that scored higher. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Was almost there!! I am very happy with the result... =) cant complain with a 2nd PB</td>', 'Originally posted by Timosaby: I was almost sure this was top 10, great job though i like this photo a lot more than some of the ones that scored higher.   Was almost there!! I am very happy with the result... =) cant complain with a 2nd PB', '2009-05-27 15:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502431, 792288, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>classical style--well done!  the placement of the shawl just slightly across her lips is perfect.  The skin softening is "glamourous" (though inhibiting it on the eyes might work a bit better--or it might not :-)</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!classical style--well done!  the placement of the shawl just slightly across her lips is perfect.  The skin softening is "glamourous" (though inhibiting it on the eyes might work a bit better--or it might not :-)', '2009-05-27 15:12:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502447, 790895, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>this has a candid feel to it, sort of grab-shot-glamour, like you called to her as she was climbing stairs and she looked back at you.  I like it.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!this has a candid feel to it, sort of grab-shot-glamour, like you called to her as she was climbing stairs and she looked back at you.  I like it.', '2009-05-27 15:17:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502451, 792118, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>well, this may not be "standard" glamour, but I like it a lot.  Odd that so many did not realize it was an underwater shot....  While doing it a night had to be frustrating, it also gave you those great blacks!<br/> <br/>Well done! (and great conversion)</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!well, this may not be "standard" glamour, but I like it a lot.  Odd that so many did not realize it was an underwater shot....  While doing it a night had to be frustrating, it also gave you those great blacks! Well done! (and great conversion)', '2009-05-27 15:19:54.000000', NULL, 0),
