(5502523, 791999, 39218, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to have seen this cropped from the original into a square, from just under her jawline to just above her eyes... keeping the hand intact... I immediately thought that the model looks very much like Madonna''s daughter Lourdes.  She''s a very classic beauty... whoever she is.</td>', 'I would have loved to have seen this cropped from the original into a square, from just under her jawline to just above her eyes... keeping the hand intact... I immediately thought that the model looks very much like Madonna''s daughter Lourdes.  She''s a very classic beauty... whoever she is.', '2009-05-27 16:02:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502542, 791999, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by VictoriaSecretGarden:</b></div><hr/><i> I would have loved to have seen this cropped from the original into a square, from just under her jawline to just above her eyes... keeping the hand intact... I immediately thought that the model looks very much like Madonna''s daughter Lourdes.  She''s a very classic beauty... whoever she is. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I know!! She does has a madonna resemblance, this shoot I did however was very 80s madonna inspired and the model turned out to be a great look-a-like!! =)<br/> <br/>Maybe if I had done a different crop it would''ve scored higher... thanks for the comment</td>', 'Originally posted by VictoriaSecretGarden: I would have loved to have seen this cropped from the original into a square, from just under her jawline to just above her eyes... keeping the hand intact... I immediately thought that the model looks very much like Madonna''s daughter Lourdes.  She''s a very classic beauty... whoever she is.   I know!! She does has a madonna resemblance, this shoot I did however was very 80s madonna inspired and the model turned out to be a great look-a-like!! =) Maybe if I had done a different crop it would''ve scored higher... thanks for the comment', '2009-05-27 16:29:10.000000', NULL, 0),
