(5502784, 792288, 20364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chromeydome:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>classical style--well done!  the placement of the shawl just slightly across her lips is perfect.  The skin softening is "glamourous" (though inhibiting it on the eyes might work a bit better--or it might not :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow! Thank you VERY much!  Didn''t expect this photo to do as well as it did, although I hoped it would and I certainly appreciate this recognition...This photo is my second personal best of all time.</td>', 'Originally posted by chromeydome: PostLuminous Award Nominee!classical style--well done!  the placement of the shawl just slightly across her lips is perfect.  The skin softening is "glamourous" (though inhibiting it on the eyes might work a bit better--or it might not :-)   Wow! Thank you VERY much!  Didn''t expect this photo to do as well as it did, although I hoped it would and I certainly appreciate this recognition...This photo is my second personal best of all time.', '2009-05-27 19:23:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502788, 792288, 20364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave this a 10. It could ribbon but DPC voters are a strange crew. <br/> <br/>There is something about this pic that keeps me looking at it! Very good job. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you!  I was hopeful it would do well and although not as well as I had hoped, I am happy with my placement.  I have been working very hard to get better and your comment (and many others) has given me some momentum.  Thanks.</td>', 'Originally posted by kenskid: I gave this a 10. It could ribbon but DPC voters are a strange crew.  There is something about this pic that keeps me looking at it! Very good job.   Thank you!  I was hopeful it would do well and although not as well as I had hoped, I am happy with my placement.  I have been working very hard to get better and your comment (and many others) has given me some momentum.  Thanks.', '2009-05-27 19:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5502794, 792288, 20364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jwaddison:</b></div><hr/><i> I think you have nailed it, I hope it ribbons. 9 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I had hoped it would have ribboned as well, but as I looked through some of the great photos, I knew it wasn''t possible.  But thanks so much for the kind words and the vote!</td>', 'Originally posted by jwaddison: I think you have nailed it, I hope it ribbons. 9   I had hoped it would have ribboned as well, but as I looked through some of the great photos, I knew it wasn''t possible.  But thanks so much for the kind words and the vote!', '2009-05-27 19:26:57.000000', NULL, 0),
