(5503138, 791360, 54645, '<td valign="top">OK Lydia, I''ve put an iron in the mail! The voters have spoken...no wrinkled backgrounds! ;) With that said, it''s clear that the repetition of the comment suggests that a glamour portrait calls for an unwrinkled background. But, I agree with Ken, I didn''t even notice the background, as I thought it was intentional.</td>', 'OK Lydia, I''ve put an iron in the mail! The voters have spoken...no wrinkled backgrounds! ;) With that said, it''s clear that the repetition of the comment suggests that a glamour portrait calls for an unwrinkled background. But, I agree with Ken, I didn''t even notice the background, as I thought it was intentional.', '2009-05-28 00:49:44.000000', NULL, 0),
