(5504532, 792339, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by librodo:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>starting june 5- i am out of job.  will be taking one whole year off work - sabbatical leave.  any invitation?:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If you ever hit the UK dude you are welcome at my small and humble flat anytime you like. I reckon I can find some models to shoot too at a push hehehe</td>', 'Originally posted by librodo: starting june 5- i am out of job.  will be taking one whole year off work - sabbatical leave.  any invitation?:)   If you ever hit the UK dude you are welcome at my small and humble flat anytime you like. I reckon I can find some models to shoot too at a push hehehe', '2009-05-29 10:42:26.000000', NULL, 0),
