(5515139, 791360, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang, she''s gorgeous!!!  (And I''m not her mother so that''s an unbiased opinion.)  I don''t mind her arm cut off at all; as for texture on the background, a textured background rather than a wrinkled one might be more please, or a VERY wrinkled one so it''s obvious it''s intentional, maybe.  Great eyes, great pose, great look, and it ended up much better than a 5.3.</td>', 'Dang, she''s gorgeous!!!  (And I''m not her mother so that''s an unbiased opinion.)  I don''t mind her arm cut off at all; as for texture on the background, a textured background rather than a wrinkled one might be more please, or a VERY wrinkled one so it''s obvious it''s intentional, maybe.  Great eyes, great pose, great look, and it ended up much better than a 5.3.', '2009-06-05 02:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5516775, 792131, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the blend of colors in this.  I left you some comments at your gallery link.  You have some beautiful work there!</td>', 'I like the blend of colors in this.  I left you some comments at your gallery link.  You have some beautiful work there!', '2009-06-06 11:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5521738, 792322, 75034, '<td valign="top">Brian, I think that you were robbed on this one. If there''s a little noise on the hair so be it but that''s not enough to bring this beautiful image to a sub 5 score. As for the expression, well it''s natural and real for someone to look as she does. I''ve shot plenty of models and head shots and I have plenty of photos with similar facial expressions. I do find this alluring :) Keep up the great work.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Brian, I think that you were robbed on this one. If there''s a little noise on the hair so be it but that''s not enough to bring this beautiful image to a sub 5 score. As for the expression, well it''s natural and real for someone to look as she does. I''ve shot plenty of models and head shots and I have plenty of photos with similar facial expressions. I do find this alluring :) Keep up the great work. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-06-09 20:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5521744, 792017, 75034, '<td valign="top">Well having been there and seen this shot in the making, I offer you this in observation of your edit. It''s really light and unfortunately lacks definition in the people, they don''t really stand out from the background. These things are not hard to fix and a look on U-Tube at stuff done by Photoshop Mama would be a big help. You should see what you can do and post a re-edit to compare the two images. <br/> <br/>I had a great time visiting you and I really look forward to doing it all again soon.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Well having been there and seen this shot in the making, I offer you this in observation of your edit. It''s really light and unfortunately lacks definition in the people, they don''t really stand out from the background. These things are not hard to fix and a look on U-Tube at stuff done by Photoshop Mama would be a big help. You should see what you can do and post a re-edit to compare the two images.  I had a great time visiting you and I really look forward to doing it all again soon. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-06-09 20:41:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5521749, 792157, 75034, '<td valign="top">Sorry Peter, but I have to agree with the other comments on this one. It is a BIG shoehorn for a glamour challenge, so big in fact that I don''t think it should have been in this challenge. That being said, I do have to look at the reasons why you would think it belongs and try to be objective in my thoughts. Could it be her look or maybe her movements or even her desire to pursue that line of work. DO any of these thoughts come close to the reasons. <br/> <br/>I guess the only true way to know is for you to tell us in the details of the photo.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Sorry Peter, but I have to agree with the other comments on this one. It is a BIG shoehorn for a glamour challenge, so big in fact that I don''t think it should have been in this challenge. That being said, I do have to look at the reasons why you would think it belongs and try to be objective in my thoughts. Could it be her look or maybe her movements or even her desire to pursue that line of work. DO any of these thoughts come close to the reasons.  I guess the only true way to know is for you to tell us in the details of the photo. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-06-09 20:49:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5521754, 792131, 75034, '<td valign="top">Well Jayson, you''ve taken some pretty harsh criticism with this shot and I can see that some people would think it DNMC but being an electrician by trade I can see a certain amount of glamour in your shot, now that''s not to say that I''m all misty eyed over the image but I''m definitely not totally opposed to it as others are.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Well Jayson, you''ve taken some pretty harsh criticism with this shot and I can see that some people would think it DNMC but being an electrician by trade I can see a certain amount of glamour in your shot, now that''s not to say that I''m all misty eyed over the image but I''m definitely not totally opposed to it as others are. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-06-09 20:55:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5521760, 790993, 75034, '<td valign="top">Naomi, not everyone will see the glamour in nature the way you do and for that your image has suffered. It''s unfortunate that this image wasn''t in a challenge more suited to it''s true beauty.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Naomi, not everyone will see the glamour in nature the way you do and for that your image has suffered. It''s unfortunate that this image wasn''t in a challenge more suited to it''s true beauty. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-06-09 21:00:54.000000', NULL, 0),
